      "role": "method_property",
      "statement": "Over the reals, the engine's bounded explicit step clamp(x + r dt) to ordered declared bounds lo <= hi always lies in [lo, hi] and equals the unclamped step when that already lies inside; the unclamped increment is linear in dt and additive over consecutive steps at one rate.",
